# This module is the BCR presubmit's test module, so it is built as a workspace
# root. That puts Bazel's convenience symlinks (bazel-out, bazel-bin, ...) in
# the same package as the `all_srcs` `glob(["**"])` below, and the second build
# in the directory then globs the output tree into the cmake source tree. Ignore
# them so the glob only ever sees the checked-in sources.
bazel-basic
bazel-bin
bazel-out
bazel-testlogs
